<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Vacation?</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">August 31. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">Another week passed by, and Darksphere only grew stronger.
She cannot be stopped! We applied for a full PoF, but got a normal spawned, with
only the wizard epic mob up (and some dr00d no good quest mob). But in the true
spirit of Darksphere, we cleaned up as promised. Have you ever seen 27 people
handle 10 PoF mobs, with some being glare lords? (without a single enchanter)
HELL NO! Darksphere shows the most incredible will I have ever seen, to stand
and fight when it looks the worst! Everyone knows what to do, main tank is being
assisted, ghetto messing along side bard messing, mobs being debuffed in row.
Ever seen 3 groups clear the temple in PoF? Not me :) Once again you showed the
world what being a member of Darksphere is really about!&nbsp;<p align="left">Our
weekly ToV raid didn't yield much, guess those giants have been bribing the
dragons again - but that just means we will get 20+ armor drops next time, so I
wont complain :P And grats to Piccolloo on his new leather latex Kael legs (I
know they dropped a few raids ago, but he just wanted to see his name in an
update... well, grats bud :) Grats to the rest of the winners - it's good to see
the guild sporting the colors of Kael Drakkal!<p align="left">Phinny the Fish
took a dirt nap once to many times (god I love epic piece farming), and after
1.003.213 times, he finally dropped what we needed! Grats Tanne on your staff
and grats Ferlos on yours. Tanne is now 2 steps away from her epic, and Ferlos...
well, a picture is worth a thousand words:
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/FerlosEpic.png" width="288" height="546"></p>
<p align="left">Ladies and Gentlemen - I present to you, the first Wizard Epic
of Darksphere! Congratulations Ferlos, you sure earned it!</p>
<p align="left">On to the boring stuff! A brand new <a href="Roster.html">Roster</a>
is up and running, with member profiles. I know, its not 100% done yet, but it
will be within the week! I made a post on the boards about it, so reply to that
if you got anything to add or comment. Go have a look, I hope you like it.</p>
<p align="left">A big welcome to all the newcomers, Xxendark, Vixie, Steelfists
and Zitly, I hope you find a new home in Darksphere, just like the rest of us.</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quote time!</b></p>
<p align="left">I KNEW he was a ranger!!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/104.jpg" width="244" height="17"></p>
<p align="left">A ghey ranger...</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/105.jpg" width="414" height="16"></p>
<p align="left">Gruz, can't I just be your raid leader? :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/106.jpg" width="404" height="16"></p>
<p align="left">Some want to bungee jump, some want to skydive or parachute,
others wanna get a good job and family - but Picco...</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/107.jpg" width="553" height="60"></p>
<p align="left">Now you just ask yourself - aint normal exp good enough? :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/108.jpg" width="524" height="15"></p>
<p align="left"><b>From the Cadence Mansion - specially delivered to you by my
spies!</b><p align="left">Senya, its time to reattach that ball and chain...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/109.jpg" width="399" height="65"><p align="left">and
more paparazzi shots from the spies! I believe this was send to Piccolloo<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/110.jpg" width="328" height="16"><p align="left">And
Bapt, never ever admit those kinda things :D&nbsp; I blame the dr00ds!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/111.jpg" width="277" height="57"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Enjoy
your vacation and Labor Day :)


