<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Kael reimbursed!</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">August 26. 2002 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b><p align="left">What an eye poking week this have been! Just got of that
piece of paradise we call Plane of Air. It's heaven on Norrath, and we just
luuub going up there! I think I lack the words to describe how much I really
really hate that place!! Yikes! Next we go up there, I'm outta town! But oh
well, we mostly got what we came for. Grats to all the winners! Vikos and
Bragnar on their epic pieces, only 2 to go guys! =) Tanne and Orduhre on your
epic pieces, to bad more didn't drop!<p align="left">Temple of Veeshan... Love
you still :P&nbsp; Last Tuesday was like x-mas day! At some point, we actually
had more armor drops that mobs killed!! Wootage! 18 pieces of armor that night!
Grats Darksphere! Can't even believe some of it went to the guild bank already!
And a big grats to Vikos, for being the first person in the guild to fashion a
full set of Kaels best armor! (damn you, beat me with a friggin bp! :) Now you
are all blue!<p align="left">Some guilds might see ultra rare loot on some rare
spawn mobs, but I think this one ranges in the top 10 of the rarest loot shots
ever!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/ToVDreamloot.png" width="129" height="155"><p align="center">OH
MY GOD!<p align="left">Picco pull more of those! :D<p align="left">Besides all
that fun, we had a little fun in Dragon Necropolis, clearing from entrance to
Zlandicars room in just about 30 mins. Good thing he is up for us on rotation
soon! He is going dooowwnn!<p align="left">Rather unusually we teamed up with
Diamond Edge and gave Sontalak a shot. Deploying the way way wrong tactics, we
still managed to get him down to 10%! This with Darksphere making up with close
to 50% of the raid force, and having 75% of all the tanks as well as supplying
the MT. Go Vikos, go Darksphere! I'm sure that with the right tactics used, a
few more members and Darksphere's willpower, we could have done that all by
ourselves!! Already discussed the various tactics with the wise guys, and as
soon as we got the numbers, we will give him a try!<p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left"><b>Quotes!
Guaranteed better than 3 days in PoA!</b><p align="left">First of all, I would
like to give Aveda (Tays shammy) a warm official welcome back to Darksphere! But
you still have to prove that you are any good :D<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/89.jpg" width="262" height="14"><p align="left">Guys,
I know its important that pullers and MTs work well together, but somehow I
think you guys spend way way to much time together!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/90.jpg" width="238" height="28"><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/91.jpg" width="245" height="29"><p align="left">...
yea well, as long as you get the job done, I don't care how :) And we all know
Brags quotes about &quot;jobs&quot;.<p align="left">And rumors have it that
Vikos is trying to get out of all that love, but geez Vik, this is just
desperate measures!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/92.jpg" width="556" height="15"><p align="left">Picco
is trying to escape too, but I don't know if this one is more desperate.<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/93.jpg" width="235" height="24"><p align="left">Well....
Grats Zacknaar?<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/94.jpg" width="212" height="29"><p align="left">I
usually buff with a smile (hahahaha), but when you tell me how good they make
you feel, I get kinda worried :P<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/95.jpg" width="283" height="17"><p align="left">And
Tanne, don't ever never say this during my raids, you just get the MTs
distracted!! :D its like neon to Vikos - you know ( . )Y( . )<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/96.jpg" width="423" height="15"><p align="left">Vikos,
I know you got tons and tons of AAs - even stopped counting them, but I didn't
know that immunity to DT was one of em...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/97.jpg" width="291" height="77"><p align="left">(you
can thank me for landing nukes at the right time later on ;)<p align="left">Gone
but not forgotten! - Rumor has it he found someone else. Brag, any idea? /shrug<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/98.jpg" width="224" height="72"><p align="left"><b>From
the Cadence mansion!</b><p align="left">No new affair, pet fantasy or fights, so
all is quite over there. However, it does seems like Dland spend some time
working on his Tailoring...<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/99.jpg" width="544" height="29"><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/100.jpg" width="232" height="16">
(yay! quote #100! :D )<p align="left">And Bragnar, ez on those tradeskills now.
Kinda getting us worried.<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/101.jpg" width="378" height="14"><p align="left">/comfort
Vikos. You are still the master potter in this guild to us!<p align="left">And
here is an offer you just cant resist!!!<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/102.jpg" width="487" height="16"><p align="left">I
would leave a CT sewerz group for that!<p align="left">And Picco, is this the
new pet name for our tanks?<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/103.jpg" width="236" height="15"><p align="left">&nbsp;<p align="left">Stay
tuned!


