<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Kael is broke!</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">August 19. 2002 - by Njall</font><p align="left">With
the amount of armor we have tapped from that place in the last 2 weeks, I'm not
all surprised to hear that the Kael armor dealers is all out of armor! Guessing
that's why we saw fewer drops last night in ToV. Giants must have made a deal
with the smelly dragons to keep us down! Bahahaha! Aint gonna happen! Weekend
was in the name of ToV, again, and we sure know how to own that place. Wanna go
hunt exp there soon? Actually think we reached 20+ armor drops in just 2 nights!
Grats to all the winners, especially Tayen on your new (very expensive Leather
BP), Bragster (Plate legs), Fabbas (Chain legs), Tanne (Silk Panties) and
finally Seclorum (Cobalt legs) from Venril Sathir =) Wootage!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/ToVLeatherBP01.png" width="172" height="122"><p align="center">Can't
believe it went for 95 dkp... Grats Tay!! ;)<p align="left">With ToV being
