Talendor, Keeper, Zlandicar and if the odds are with us, Cazic Thule himself
will be waiting for us, rdy to apologize to us for crashing PoF the last time we
had it!<p align="left">I know, I know, my website work hasn't been anything to
write home about lately, but now I promise you I'm back! =) More victims added
